flowchart LR
  UI[Sources/HerdrM · macOS UI] --> HK[Packages/HerdrKit · HerdrService]
  HK --> RPC[SocketRPC]
  HK --> SSH[SSHTunnel]
  RPC --> US[本地或转发的 Unix API socket]
  SSH --> RH[远端 herdr]
  US --> HD[herdr daemon · PTY 与持久化]
  UI --> ST[SwiftTerm]
  ST --> ATT[herdr agent/terminal attach]
  ATT --> HD
